# The Witch IV shelf: every one of its twenty toys plays, bands of them with the conductors sound
# sane, and the shelf's fourth page lists them.
wait 100
seat 1 turing 1234
seat 2 sleepwalk 77
seat 3 seance 5
seat 4 fractal 9
seat 5 chimes 3
seat 6 static 8
seat 7 culling 1
seat 8 moon 2
expect seated 8
wav witch4.wav
tap PLAY
wait 16000
expect playing 1
expect notes >80
expect peak_db_min -30
expect peak_db_max 0
wavstop
tap PLAY
wait 100
seat 1 ratchet 11
seat 2 pulsar 12
seat 3 lichen 13
seat 4 oracle 14
seat 5 whisper 15
seat 6 markovkit 16
seat 7 automaton 17
seat 8 hysteria 18
tap PLAY
wait 8000
expect notes >200
tap PLAY
wait 100
seat 1 round 21
seat 2 loom 22
seat 3 golden 23
seat 4 haunting 24
tap PLAY
wait 8000
expect notes >300
tap PLAY
wait 100
# Moon has gone home: the scale is back where it started
expect scale 1
# the shelf's fourth page
tap HOME
wait 50
tap OCT-
wait 50
expect browse 1
shot shelf4.png
tapkey w0
wait 50
